# Convex's own agent tooling. `npx convex dev` installs this through
# `convex ai-files install` and rewrites it on every run, so committing it would
# churn the log and bury the product under a vendor skill catalogue.
#
# The `.agents/skills/` entries below this are the ones this project curates for
# itself, and they stay tracked.
.claude/
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
skills-lock.json
convex/_generated/ai/
.agents/skills/convex/
.agents/skills/convex-*/
!.agents/skills/convex-hackathon-skill/
